#### Product Overview

This high-quality rubber mallet delivers high force without damaging your workpiece. The solid rubber head provides heavy duty power behind each strike of the mallet to form sheet metal, shift plasterboard, and upholstery work. The smooth hardwood handle provides quality leverage while protecting your hands as you work.

- Solid rubber head
- Hardwood handle
- Striking face: 2-3/4 in.

